===Etymology 3===
From {{m|pl|bez}}, due to confusion with the rhyming preposition {{m|pl|przez}}. The two words were and are used interchangeably in various dialects, and in [[:Wikipedia:Old Polish|Old Polish]] ''przez'' was about to replace ''bez'' around the 14th-15th century. In the written language the earlier distinction ultimately prevailed, however.<ref name="brue">{{R:pl:Bruckner|bez|page=21}}</ref>

